      split; [g8 HLF (EVar 2) (-250)|]. split; [g8 HLF (EVar 2) (-249)|]. split; [g8 HLF (EVar 2) (-248)|]. g8 HLF (EVar 2) (-244).
    + apply (TK.frame_samem _ _ _ _ _ _ _ HLF). intros a Ha (Hk1 & Hk2 & Hk3 & Hk4). cbn [CC.cp_F]. tk_outside.
